+### Task 3: HorizontalFeatureScroll 核心
+
+**Files:**
+- Create: `src/components/horizontal-feature-scroll.jsx`
+- Create: `src/hooks/use-media-query.js`（若项目无现成可复用则新建；优先复用 `subscribeToMediaQueryChange`）
+
+**Step 1: 实现 sticky 横滑**
+
+- 外层 `height: panelCount * 100vh`
+- 内层 sticky `h-screen overflow-hidden`
+- `motion.div` 用 `useMotionValue` + `useSpring`（或轻量 lerp）驱动 `x`
+- 进度点绑定 `activeIndex`
+- `prefers-reduced-motion` 或 `max-width: 768px`：渲染纵向堆叠，不启用 sticky 横滑
+- 提供 `aria-label` / 可跳过提示
+
+**Step 2: 手动验收清单（dev 时）**
+
+- 下滑推进、上滑回退
+- 进度点同步
+- 窄屏纵向降级
+
+**Step 3: Commit**
+
+```bash
+git add src/components/horizontal-feature-scroll.jsx src/hooks/use-media-query.js
+git commit -m "feat: add sticky horizontal feature scroll"
+```
